        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://honeapathsc.com/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Honea Path may be named for early landowner William Honey, or it could be a Cherokee word for path.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
